  {
    "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/temporary/8997e78f-650d-4d52-b9ff-a78dc2eb4153",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/en/events/echos-du-coeur-saguenay/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Allow yourself to be swept"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTRE IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\nECHOES OF THE HEART\nHarmonies of the Sarod & the Tabla\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAllow yourself to be swept away by the enchanting melodies of Abhishek Lahiri on the sarod and the pulsating rhythms of Indranil Mallick on the tabla. Don’t miss this unique event that celebrates the best of Indian classical music, a true ode to artistic emotion capturing the essence and soul of India, a country with a rich heritage and captivating traditions.\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtistes\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSarod: Abhisek Lahiri\nTabla: Indranil Mallick\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSunday April 28, 2024\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2:30pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChapelle Saint-Cyriac\n5618 Rue de la chapelle\nLac Kénogami, QC G7X 0H9\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTickets :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tlepointdevente.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
