      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTER IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\nINDIA’S NATIONAL TREASURE AND MUSICAL LEGENT\nTHE ONE AND ONLY\nUstad Shujaat Husain Khan\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtistes\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShujaat Husain Khan\nAmit Choubey\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSunday 6th October 2024\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t5:30 pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKailash Mital Theatre\n1125 Colonel By Drive\nOttawa, ON, K1S 5B6\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTickets :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tpointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
      }
